    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tălăus</span></b> , i,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ταλαός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an Argonaut</i>,
				<i>the father of Adrastus and Eriphyle</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Ib.
			356</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tălăīŏnĭdes</span></b> ,
				ae, m., <i>one sprung
				from Talaus</i>, <i>the offspring of Talaus</i>,
			of <i>Adrastus</i>, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 5,
				18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 140</span></i>; of <i>Eriphyle</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 3, 13</span></i>.</div>
